<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8" standalone="yes"?><rss version="2.0" xmlns:atom="http://www.w3.org/2005/Atom"><channel><title>Hands-on Practical Tasks on SDET Interview Preparation Kit</title><link>https://notxkcd.github.io/sdet-prep-site/06_hands_on_tasks/</link><description>Recent content in Hands-on Practical Tasks on SDET Interview Preparation Kit</description><generator>Hugo</generator><language>en-us</language><lastBuildDate>Fri, 30 Jan 2026 00:00:00 +0000</lastBuildDate><atom:link href="https://notxkcd.github.io/sdet-prep-site/06_hands_on_tasks/index.xml" rel="self" type="application/rss+xml"/><item><title>My Script: Practical Code</title><link>https://notxkcd.github.io/sdet-prep-site/06_hands_on_tasks/my-script/</link><pubDate>Fri, 30 Jan 2026 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><guid>https://notxkcd.github.io/sdet-prep-site/06_hands_on_tasks/my-script/</guid><description>&lt;h2 id="1-java-reverse-a-string"&gt;1. Java: Reverse a String&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;ldquo;I prefer using a &lt;code&gt;StringBuilder&lt;/code&gt; for efficiency, or a simple &lt;code&gt;for&lt;/code&gt; loop if asked to show logic:&amp;rdquo;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div class="highlight"&gt;&lt;pre tabindex="0" style="color:#586e75;background-color:#eee8d5;-moz-tab-size:4;-o-tab-size:4;tab-size:4;"&gt;&lt;code class="language-java" data-lang="java"&gt;&lt;span style="display:flex;"&gt;&lt;span&gt;&lt;span style="color:#859900"&gt;public&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span style="color:#268bd2"&gt;String&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span style="color:#268bd2"&gt;reverse&lt;/span&gt;(&lt;span style="color:#268bd2"&gt;String&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span style="color:#268bd2"&gt;str&lt;/span&gt;) {
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="display:flex;"&gt;&lt;span&gt; &lt;span style="color:#268bd2"&gt;String&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span style="color:#268bd2"&gt;rev&lt;/span&gt; = &lt;span style="color:#2aa198"&gt;&amp;#34;&amp;#34;&lt;/span&gt;;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="display:flex;"&gt;&lt;span&gt; &lt;span style="color:#859900"&gt;for&lt;/span&gt;(&lt;span style="color:#859900;font-weight:bold"&gt;int&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span style="color:#268bd2"&gt;i&lt;/span&gt; = &lt;span style="color:#268bd2"&gt;str&lt;/span&gt;.&lt;span style="color:#268bd2"&gt;length&lt;/span&gt;()-&lt;span style="color:#268bd2"&gt;1&lt;/span&gt;; &lt;span style="color:#268bd2"&gt;i&lt;/span&gt; &amp;gt;= &lt;span style="color:#268bd2"&gt;0&lt;/span&gt;; &lt;span style="color:#268bd2"&gt;i&lt;/span&gt;--) {
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="display:flex;"&gt;&lt;span&gt; &lt;span style="color:#268bd2"&gt;rev&lt;/span&gt; = &lt;span style="color:#268bd2"&gt;rev&lt;/span&gt; + &lt;span style="color:#268bd2"&gt;str&lt;/span&gt;.&lt;span style="color:#268bd2"&gt;charAt&lt;/span&gt;(&lt;span style="color:#268bd2"&gt;i&lt;/span&gt;);
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="display:flex;"&gt;&lt;span&gt; }
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="display:flex;"&gt;&lt;span&gt; &lt;span style="color:#859900"&gt;return&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span style="color:#268bd2"&gt;rev&lt;/span&gt;;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="display:flex;"&gt;&lt;span&gt;}
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;h2 id="2-selenium-handling-windowspopups"&gt;2. Selenium: Handling Windows/Popups&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;ldquo;I use &lt;code&gt;driver.getWindowHandles()&lt;/code&gt; to get the set of IDs, then iterate through them to switch focus:&amp;rdquo;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div class="highlight"&gt;&lt;pre tabindex="0" style="color:#586e75;background-color:#eee8d5;-moz-tab-size:4;-o-tab-size:4;tab-size:4;"&gt;&lt;code class="language-java" data-lang="java"&gt;&lt;span style="display:flex;"&gt;&lt;span&gt;&lt;span style="color:#268bd2"&gt;String&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span style="color:#268bd2"&gt;parent&lt;/span&gt; = &lt;span style="color:#268bd2"&gt;driver&lt;/span&gt;.&lt;span style="color:#268bd2"&gt;getWindowHandle&lt;/span&gt;();
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="display:flex;"&gt;&lt;span&gt;&lt;span style="color:#268bd2"&gt;Set&lt;/span&gt;&amp;lt;&lt;span style="color:#268bd2"&gt;String&lt;/span&gt;&amp;gt; &lt;span style="color:#268bd2"&gt;allWindows&lt;/span&gt; = &lt;span style="color:#268bd2"&gt;driver&lt;/span&gt;.&lt;span style="color:#268bd2"&gt;getWindowHandles&lt;/span&gt;();
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="display:flex;"&gt;&lt;span&gt;&lt;span style="color:#859900"&gt;for&lt;/span&gt;(&lt;span style="color:#268bd2"&gt;String&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span style="color:#268bd2"&gt;handle&lt;/span&gt; : &lt;span style="color:#268bd2"&gt;allWindows&lt;/span&gt;) {
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="display:flex;"&gt;&lt;span&gt; &lt;span style="color:#859900"&gt;if&lt;/span&gt;(!&lt;span style="color:#268bd2"&gt;handle&lt;/span&gt;.&lt;span style="color:#268bd2"&gt;equals&lt;/span&gt;(&lt;span style="color:#268bd2"&gt;parent&lt;/span&gt;)) {
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="display:flex;"&gt;&lt;span&gt; &lt;span style="color:#268bd2"&gt;driver&lt;/span&gt;.&lt;span style="color:#268bd2"&gt;switchTo&lt;/span&gt;().&lt;span style="color:#268bd2"&gt;window&lt;/span&gt;(&lt;span style="color:#268bd2"&gt;handle&lt;/span&gt;);
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="display:flex;"&gt;&lt;span&gt; }
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="display:flex;"&gt;&lt;span&gt;}
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;h2 id="3-sql-the-join-query"&gt;3. SQL: The Join Query&lt;/h2&gt;
